# Prefilter modes

- GUI **Analyze…** must use `GUI_DEFAULT_PREFILTER_MODE` (`controller`) from `maze/pipeline/trial_filters.py`.
- `maze-legacy-db run` uses `prefilter_mode=legacy` (frame-diff + mistrial gates).
- `auto` infers per trial from manifest (`input_h5_path` empty ⇒ controller-style).
- Do not silently change which trials are skipped when touching GUI or batch paths — keep mode explicit in logs/dialogs (`prefilter_mode_summary`).
